> Preserved source diagnostics

Every original PNG is reproduced by the complete program and copied below. Red/blue sequence cells encode token signs, black strips identify cues, and derivative previews show the source input signal with padded positions zero. Truncated-BPTT images show the stopped backward graph, not full forward sensitivity.

input_gradients.png.

